# .env — AGGREGATOR NODE CONFIGURATION
#
# Copy to .env before deploying. Never commit it.
#
# Nothing here is required. Every setting has a working default baked into
# docker-compose.yml (`${KEY:-default}`), so an aggregator that has never heard
# of a new setting still comes up correctly. Only add a key when this machine
# genuinely differs, or to hold a secret.
#
# Adding a feature? Give it a default in the compose file, document it in the
# README table, and leave this file alone. See TODO.md → "env defaults live in
# compose" for the reasoning.
#
# Grafana login is NOT managed here. Default is admin / admin and Grafana
# prompts for a change on first login — deliberately better than a plaintext
# password sitting in this file.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETS — the only things that really belong in this file
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Grafana service account token, used by theseus for datasource lookup and
# deeplink generation. Viewer role is enough.
# Grafana → Administration → Service accounts → Add service account.
#GRAFANA_TOKEN=

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THIS-MACHINE VALUES
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The address YOU use to reach Grafana in a browser. Theseus builds the
# clickable "DETAILS" deeplinks from it. Unset falls back to the in-network
# address, which only resolves from inside the Docker network — so links handed
# to a browser will be dead. Set it on any aggregator whose links leave the box.
#GRAFANA_EXTERNAL_URL=http://<this-host>:3000

# Kubernetes control-plane API (https://<internal-ip>:6443). Set only on the
# aggregator that owns a cluster; enables on-demand pod log tailing via theseus.
# Reuses the token from `make kube`. Use the InternalIP, never 127.0.0.1 —
# that's localhost inside the container. Absent → pod log tailing off.
#K8S_API_URL=

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OVERRIDES — only if you have a conflict
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# All optional. Defaults are in aggregator/docker-compose.yml; the full list
# with values lives in README.md. Common ones:
#
#   AGGREGATOR_PROM_PORT   9090    must match every collector's .env
#   AGGREGATOR_LOKI_PORT   3100    must match every collector's .env
#   GRAFANA_PORT           3000
#   THESEUS_PORT           8182
#   PROM_RETENTION         90d
#   LOKI_RETENTION         744h    31 days
#   GRAFANA_ANON           false   Viewer-only anonymous read; on for a public map
#   AGGROBOARD_INTERVAL    60      theseus heartbeat, seconds
#   GRAFANA_URL                    in-network Grafana address; changing this is rare
